      "first": {
        "speaker": 0,
        "line": 1,
        "text": "An impressive collection. You have some very rare editions here. Sure you want to sell them all? (Dean Corso, a tall, lean, rather unkempt man in his 30's. Steel-rimmed glasses, crumpled old tweed jacket, worn cords, scuffed brown oxfords. He replaces a book on a shelf."
      },
      "last": {
        "speaker": 0,
        "line": 600,
        "text": "But they were here not long ago - I spoke with them."
